Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.60,subtitle_1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819,272)\fad(200,200)}MILDLY ELSEWHERE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.60,subtitle_2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,1346)}He flooded his\Nown basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:03.10,subtitle_3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(533,1346)\fad(200,200)}the day before\Nthe river could.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:10.40,subtitle_4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(820,272)}MILDLY ELSEWHERE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.90,subtitle_5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1350)\fad(200,200)}The whole street\Nis stacking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.10,subtitle_6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1349)}sandbags,\Nand he's running
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:07.60,subtitle_7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537,1344)}a hose into\Nhis basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.30,subtitle_8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1351)\fad(200,200)}His neighbor\Nhas three pumps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.60,subtitle_9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,1350)\fad(200,200)}going\Nand yells over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.50,subtitle_10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(899,271)\fad(200,200)}SEWHERE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.20,subtitle_11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(542,1346)\fad(200,200)}"Flood's not till\Ntomorrow, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:13.50,subtitle_12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1394)}You're early!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:14.10,subtitle_13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1342)\fad(200,200)}But he\Ncarries the couch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:15.40,subtitle_14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,1399)}upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.50,subtitle_15,,0,0,0,,{\pos(535,1349)}shuts off\Nthe power,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.50,subtitle_16,,0,0,0,,{\pos(532,1350)}and fills it to\Nthe top step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:19.70,subtitle_17,,0,0,0,,{\pos(541,1342)}By dinner,\Nthe whole street
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.60,subtitle_18,,0,0,0,,{\pos(535,1346)}is calling it\Nthe indoor pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.00,subtitle_19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1293)}Then the river
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:22.80,label_20,,0,0,0,,{\pos(543,1396)}comes over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:23.80,subtitle_21,,0,0,0,,{\pos(534,1391)}the bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:24.10,subtitle_22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(541,1298)}and both houses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:24.10,subtitle_23,,0,0,0,,{\pos(532,1396)}end up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.50,subtitle_24,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,1392)}in a brown lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.50,subtitle_25,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1348)}Next door,\Nthe pumps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:28.10,subtitle_26,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1346)}are winning,\Nand the neighbor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.50,subtitle_27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1348)}yells,\N"How's the pool?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.50,subtitle_28,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537,1396)}But by sunset,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:32.80,subtitle_29,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1349)}there's a crack\Nin the neighbor's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.90,subtitle_30,,0,0,0,,{\pos(532,1391)}thin as a hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:35.10,subtitle_31,,0,0,0,,{\pos(535,1399)}By midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.30,subtitle_32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1348)}it's wide enough\Nfor a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:38.00,subtitle_33,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537,1349)}and the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:38.60,subtitle_34,,0,0,0,,{\pos(535,1395)\fad(200,200)}is bending in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.10,subtitle_35,,0,0,0,,{\pos(542,1342)}You see,\Nsoaked dirt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:41.30,subtitle_36,,0,0,0,,{\pos(533,1397)\fad(200,200)}is heavy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.60,subtitle_37,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1344)}and it leans on\Na basement wall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.50,subtitle_38,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1343)}like a parked\Ntruck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.30,subtitle_39,,0,0,0,,{\pos(541,1348)}Ever squeezed\Nan empty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:46.40,subtitle_40,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1392)\fad(200,200)}soda can?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.30,subtitle_41,,0,0,0,,{\pos(533,1394)\fad(200,200)}It crumples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.70,subtitle_42,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1351)}A full one\Nwon't give.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:50.10,subtitle_43,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1351)\fad(200,200)}With water inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.10,subtitle_44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1397)\fad(200,200)}pushing back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.60,subtitle_45,,0,0,0,,{\pos(533,1396)\fad(200,200)}just as hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:52.60,subtitle_46,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1341)}the indoor pool's\Nwalls feel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:54.80,subtitle_47,,0,0,0,,{\pos(532,1393)}almost nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:55.90,subtitle_48,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1348)}Flood guides\Nreally say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:56.80,subtitle_49,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537,1393)}to let the water in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:57.70,subtitle_50,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1397)}and not pump
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:00:59.10,subtitle_51,,0,0,0,,{\pos(529,1347)}until the\Nriver drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:00.10,subtitle_52,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,1393)}A week later,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:01.60,subtitle_53,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1346)\fad(200,200)}he drains\Nhis pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:02.60,subtitle_54,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537,1394)\fad(200,200)}nice and slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:03.90,subtitle_55,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1392)}off a wet floor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.00,subtitle_56,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1346)}and four\Nstraight walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:06.80,subtitle_57,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,1348)}Next door,\Nthe neighbor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.10,subtitle_58,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,1348)}is pumping\Nhis out too,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:09.50,subtitle_59,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1346)}except\Nhis kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.10,subtitle_60,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539,1344)}is down there\Nwith it.
